y to go up and down stairs?"}, {"id": "PFA41", "text": "Are you able to squat and get up?"}, {"id": "PFC40", "text": "Are you able to kneel on the floor?"}]}]}, {"kind": "matrix", "id": "supp_block_5", "title": "Physical Activity and Mobility", "instructions": "", "options": [{"value": 5, "label": "A case of water bottles from Costco (44 lbs / 20 kg)"}, {"value": 4, "label": "A small child (25 lbs / 12 kg)"}, {"value": 3, "label": "A shopping bag (10 lbs / 5 kg)"}, {"value": 2, "label": "A can of soup (1 lb / 0.5 kg)"}, {"value": 1, "label": "Unable to lift from the floor"}], "sections": [{"header": "Physical Activity and Mobility", "items": [{"id": "SUP-29", "text": "What is the heaviest weight you are able to lift from the floor to waist height?"}]}]}, {"kind": "matrix", "id": "supp_block_6", "title": "Sensory Function", "instructions": "", "options": [{"value": 5, "label": "No difficulty"}, {"value": 4, "label": "Mild difficulty"}, {"value": 3, "label": "Moderate difficulty"}, {"value": 2, "label": "Severe difficulty"}, {"value": 1, "label": "Unable / profound difficulty"}], "sections": [{"header": "Sensory Function", "items": [{"id": "SUP-74", "text": "How much difficulty do you have seeing (with glasses or contacts if you use them) - for example reading ordinary print or recognizing faces?"}, {"id": "SUP-75", "text": "How much difficulty do you have hearing (with a hearing aid if you use one) - for example following a conversation?"}, {"id": "SUP-76", "text": "How much difficulty do you have feeling things with your hands or feet - for example numbness, tingling, or trouble sensing hot and cold?"}, {"id": "SUP-77", "text": "How much difficulty do you have tasting food and drink?"}, {"id": "SUP-78", "text": "How much difficulty do you have smelling things, such as food or smoke?"}]}]}, {"kind": "matrix", "id": "supp_block_7", "title": "Hand and Arm Use", "instructions": "", "options": [{"value": 5, "label": "Without any difficulty"}, {"value": 4, "label": "With 